{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41841","headline":"寄庐山白大师 · 李中","name":"寄庐山白大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长忆寻师处，东林寓泊时。\n一秋同看月，无夜不论诗。\n泉美茶香异，堂深磬韵迟。\n鹿驯眠藓径，猨苦叫霜枝。\n别後音尘隔，年来鬓发衰。\n趋名方汲汲，未果再游期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}